    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50dffd20bbbd4fcb40d095a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自她毕业之后，我还是第一次看见那孩子奔跑的模样。\r\n以前她还在我父亲开办的比赛教室里的时候，\r\n我倒是经常看见她奔跑哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a57a9909a7f61b948620f508a22b37b7f5653077db042f24be45637373db0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
