    {
      "uid": "zhcn:458caf42c6bf21a877ffe7e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后，庆典还是输掉了。但即便如此，\r\n她也在一瞬间曾扼住过“世界”的咽喉。\r\n……虽然跑完后整个人累得不行，直接倒在地上动弹不得就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "285d1807f25853a0fa424db032374e432075cec370cec6162b2f0f051d7902ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
