    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c08752b9c5ee2f1b8b0cd9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……嗯？你是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6a2d45566d36170a1989d7f49c9b3b1e00e10acae6dde7ae64c3812545d4049",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdedd19a6b9b57c5c570e875",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我指指胸前的训练员徽章，向她说明了我这几天的经历：\r\n从我被她从摩托上救下开始，说到她的选拔赛结束。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51baf489b6f03c560b60639122341e7a4a5d50c0c99e8e287abebea22d3f2855",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cda287d066521b3549899e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我看过你和海外赛马娘的比赛录像了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874062f06acefba93df454309da475bfec97f78e3baa3ac0d8d4c55e3a14ed29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4d26179309046eb7c65b9e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我看过你和海外赛马娘的比赛录像了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874062f06acefba93df454309da475bfec97f78e3baa3ac0d8d4c55e3a14ed29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "choice_data_list",
