      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2de5aa7a799c7738225ea1fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c202db2755a9750c0769d373f4610457612e8abd3feb5044ef7914f3c657dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284b364550c62714487f6e77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嘿……我还在想这变态似乎在哪儿见过，没想到是你啊。\r\n然后……你有何高见啊？想让我认真跑步吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e657aa76c3712679577e3ca39fa20fdbe5b3f0e1163b63f330389113a3938007",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20a9d734fe5b86a2b404c26d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c202db2755a9750c0769d373f4610457612e8abd3feb5044ef7914f3c657dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b7a83abfc364d76cdbd5165",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……！你难道已经找过老师了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "806eb21d605fddfd8c1264ee43b816d0227f0e0257026b74b8e1dd02d8364c0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edd5a184f1c89f6a0a489b19",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山的原班主任",
      "source_fingerprint": "a041ed342547346684eb2e96b916fdcb947663684b2c80d97fc16dd9fbc77012",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99455df16836605a3e69975e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然说是这么说啦，那位赛马娘估计也没放把她在心上吧。\r\n她也只是觉得那个自由竞技场和故乡的草地很像，\r\n所以来消遣一会儿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "450d33c32800fa48a0d991e500d06e3660c21180b64f87ce0491f41d4d95bac6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc3e4e81012a5fad672c1197",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c202db2755a9750c0769d373f4610457612e8abd3feb5044ef7914f3c657dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9926fe03da286c29c156ca22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……那场比赛就是场美梦，我走了狗屎运而已。\r\n都看过我的选拔赛了，还不明白吗？\r\n我没本事再跑一场那样的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56e6363809bf21d76afe0f9aa3fdfd8ebaeaa6d3c1432193ca20996aaeb7f1c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6b4731b7050e416d43077d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不会那样的。我来让你“活过来”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6541f5dedc5b2585b876cd0a1cc4ce752193c1bfacefc986c57cec7c19beb991",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
