    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb0bd76ba4d5e8881d505f43",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我充其量就是变成个出道战也赢不了，每天只会乱发脾气的废柴赛马娘。\r\n……就像个小鬼一样，成天嚷嚷着自己提不起干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71126340a3b9416918fcd7098cecec5c42da6e190498dc022f1389570e64594b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
