    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed0b097fea0c30eed56a88ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果她追求的就是一场让人浑身发麻的豪赌的话，\r\n那主动把自己逼入绝境、切断所有退路就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce61c328c1ace170bf9ddcd9996375e23d06f8e7180bb80e668bc2b1dff10de2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
