    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4949abdfc0df5f4e9e257652",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论成败。无论会得到的是赞赏还是蔑视。\r\n反正一切都在赌局之后，而我们要的——只有赌局本身。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52106e57cba91815128728b7d217eebc6c2e694da39d087df9a4f668fea43755",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
